Evaluate the example that follows. Which index pair does this scan return?
int[] a = {2, 4, 6, 7, 9, 12, 14, 16};
int i = 0, j = a.length - 1;
while (i < j) { int s = a[i] + a[j]; if (s == 23) return new int[]{i, j}; if (s < 23) i++; else j--; }
return new int[]{-1, -1};

